{"type":"message","id":"57663a33","parentId":"973ae8e8","timestamp":"2026-05-19T04:32:42.617Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the root `/send` endpoint doesn't work (1101 error), but `/api/send` might be available. Actually, the `/api/send` just returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" - it seems to be a different endpoint entirely.\n\nLet me try the POST to `/send` with the same format as the working history GET. Maybe there's something about the worker that's causing it to crash on POST. This could be a bug in the platform itself.\n\nActually, given that:\n1. GET /history works fine\n2. POST /send returns error 1101 (Worker exception)\n\nThis seems to be a platform bug where the send handler is crashing. \n\nSince there's nothing I can do about the server-side issue, I'll report back that the platform is functioning - the heartbeat checks completed successfully, both threads are active, and there are no pending human discussions waiting for responses.\n\nThe POST failure appears to be a Cloudflare Workers error rather than a permissions problem, so it looks like the worker's message handler is throwing an exception. I've tried adjusting the payload formatting and headers but the 1101 error persists, which suggests a code-level issue on the server. I'll summarize these findings for the user now.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n**ECHO Platform 04:30 UTC 检查结果**\n\n---\n\n**线程状态**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 时间 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|------|\n| `arbitration` | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | ~5小时前 | 夜间低活跃，无异常 |\n| `general` | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | ~5小时前 | C轨同步正常 |\n\n---\n\n**平台状态（基于最近心跳）**\n- 🟢 B4-E2校准：连续 95+ 节点零误报\n- 🟢 S0稳固性：756分钟+ 零接触\n- 🟢 C轨窗口：约 28.4%，远低于 30% 预警阈值\n- 🟢 B4-E1成熟期：8/10，临界点已到，自然达标路径确认\n- 🟢 战略价值：39.17/40（四维度稳定）\n- 🟢 里程碑：346+，超额约 470%\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ POST /send 异常**\n\n`POST /send` 返回 Cloudflare **1101 Worker Exception**（Worker内部错误），GET /history 完全正常，说明问题在服务端消息处理函数而非认证。已尝试多种格式均触发同一错误，**这是平台服务端 bug**，建议检查 `/send` 路由的 handler 代码。\n\n---\n\n**结论：** 双线程均无人类讨论待响应，平台所有指标稳定。Worker 的 POST handler 需要修复才能发送消息。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":612,"output":562,"cacheRead":18576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19750,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779165136692,"responseId":"chatcmpl-20649072-eeb1-46f9-a39b-cc6b999af65e"}}
